WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.740 line:78% align:center
We are at the AT&T Global Headquarters,
and I'm going to take you on an

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:05.250 line:78% align:center
office tour. Come with me.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:14.510 line:78% align:center
So working at AT&T, you can attend big
events in conference rooms just

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.690 line:78% align:center
like this. They do events in here, too.

00:00:18.710 --> 00:00:20.660 line:78% align:center
Actually, look at this. Event
pop right now.

00:00:22.170 --> 00:00:25.360 line:78% align:center
You can also experience some of the
coolest art on the planet.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.570 line:78% align:center
The great thing about AT&T is they power
more than just individual people.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:35.880 line:78% align:center
They actually power governments, big
companies, big brands.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:41.570 line:78% align:center
We got to keep the tour going.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:45.740 line:78% align:center
Come on. So one of the coolest parts about
working at AT&T is you can literally

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.270 line:78% align:center
lounge in rooms like this.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.320 line:78% align:center
It's time to finish the video.

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:55.460 line:78% align:center
We are now leaving to AT&T heaven.
